# Git LFS Configuration for Epstein Files Hub
# God Tier Architecture - Monolithic Density with Large File Support
# 
# This configuration ensures large files are handled efficiently
# through Git LFS while maintaining repository performance.

# =============================================================================
# PDF Documents - Primary Data Assets
# =============================================================================

# All PDFs tracked with LFS (critical for court documents, FBI files)
*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# =============================================================================
# Image Files - Evidence and Visual Documentation
# =============================================================================

